ind":"update","title":"NODGE Demo Update: Boss Fights are here! (+ first-launch stutter fix)","summary":"A big one today: the NODGE demo now has boss fights! Every song has its own boss, and both demo tracks get one. NEW: Boss Fights THE MAINFRAME (Neon Circuit): a rogue processor that fights with live circuit traces, bit-pattern walls and a firewall you have to survive. THE WATCHER (Neon Hemorrhage): a demonic eye that floods the arena with bullet storms and containment rings. Each fight plays the whole song and shifts between phases on the beat: arena, side-scroller, survive and the tunnel grid. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T21:51:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034294","verified_at":"2026-10-23T02:42:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4632990-1846651706692926","game_id":"steam-4632990","kind":"announcement","title":"NODGE DEMO IS LIVE","summary":"It's finally here, NODGE is playable right now as part of Steam Next Fest (October 19–26). It's free. Go try it.The core loop is dead simple: dodge obstacles, stay alive, get better. One mistake and you're restarting. No checkpoints, no second chances—just you and increasingly impossible patterns set to music. It sounds brutal because it is. But that's kind of the point.The difficulty doesn't ease up. The longer you survive, the more the game throws at you. Patterns get chaotic, timing gets tigh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T22:17:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692926","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4632990":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:16:49Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:16